Brienne is a pale elf of older years, with pure white hair pulled back, wearing a lab coat treated and pressed as if for a surgical suite. She keeps no gloves on her hands but has a front pocket where a pair could be pulled. She looks enough like [[Org/Pale Lantern Society/People/Manus Sudrenus|Manus Sudrenus]] that the two could be related. She and Manus are the two of the [[Org/Pale Lantern Society/index|Pale Lantern Society]] who stand out as its powerful members.

Brienne is a member of [[Org/Pale Lantern Society/index|Pale Lantern Society]].
